desc: Remove blank lines
category: ex
par: 7
hint1: Two substitutions or one clever command
hint2: :v matches lines that DON'T contain a pattern — delete those lines
solution: :v/./d<CR>
note: :v/./d deletes every line with no character at all — i.e. the blank lines.
--- START ---
hello

world

foo

bar
--- GOAL ---
hello
world
foo
bar
--- END ---
